suggestion:
如果 GetLocalPrice 是异步方法，应该使用 await 等待：
```csharp
if (createAppleLocalPriceList.Count > 0)
{
    var tasks = createAppleLocalPriceList.Select(item => 
        AppStoreConnectAPIService.GetLocalPrice(req.AppGroup, item));
    await Task.WhenAll(tasks).ConfigureAwait(false);
}
```
如果是同步方法，需要添加异常处理。如果确实需要后台执行，应使用 Task.Run 并处理异常：
```csharp
Task.Run(async () => {
    try {
        await AppStoreConnectAPIService.GetLocalPrice(req.AppGroup, item);
    } catch (Exception ex) {
        Logger.Error(ex, "创建Apple本地价格失败: {AppGroup}, {SubscriptionGroup}", req.AppGroup, item);
    }
});
```

为所有 GetLocalPrice 调用添加异常处理：
```csharp
if (createAppleLocalPriceList.Count > 0)
{
    foreach (var item in createAppleLocalPriceList)
    {
        try
        {
            await AppStoreConnectAPIService.GetLocalPrice(req.AppGroup, item).ConfigureAwait(false);
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            Logger.Error(ex, "创建Apple本地价格失败: AppGroup={AppGroup}, SubscriptionGroup={SubscriptionGroup}", req.AppGroup, item);
        }
    }
}
```

